# File managed by Ansible - https://github.com/pedbarbosa/ansible
# Runs once at the end of boot.

# The router hung every so often: tx/rx queues stopped on every core and on
# eth0/eth1. Turning off RX GRO list on eth0 fixed it. Turning off
# tso/gso/gro on eth0 and eth1 wasn't needed, and irqbalance wasn't the
# cause.
ethtool -K eth0 rx-gro-list off

exit 0
